				<properties documentation="Isn't TM_CoordinateSystem a TemporalMeasureCS?  It's defined as a &quot;A system for measuring time on a continuous interval scale using a single standard time interval.&quot; A TemporalMeasureCS is defined as a &quot;one-dimensional coordinate system used to record a time as a real number&quot;,&#xA;  " isSpecification="false" sType="Note" nType="0" scope="public"/>
