				<properties documentation="non-repeating sequence of coordinate system axes that spans a given coordinate space&#xA;Note: A coordinate system is derived from a set of mathematical rules for specifying how coordinates in a given space are to be assigned to points. The coordinate values in a coordinate tuple shall be recorded in the order in which the coordinate system axes associations are recorded." isSpecification="false" sType="Class" nType="0" scope="public" stereotype="interface" isRoot="false" isLeaf="false" isAbstract="true" isActive="false"/>
